=== Page 1 ===
The city library opens at nine in the morning from Monday to Saturday. Members can borrow up to ten books at a time.

=== Page 2 ===
Books must be returned within three weeks. A loan can be renewed twice online or at the front desk.

=== Page 3 ===
The reading room on the second floor is reserved for quiet study. Group work is allowed in the meeting rooms on the ground floor.

=== Page 4 ===
Library cards are free for residents and students. Visitors can request a temporary card with an identity document.